{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は早起きして\nお仕事で家を出たので\n1日長く感じます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、今日1日\nよく食べた！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ過ぎた！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと明日も食べ過ぎちゃうと思うけど\n明後日から頑張るので許してください(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/20/7909360/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/20/7909360/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆さん発売中です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/20/7909360/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間に６月の１９日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう後半戦に入りますね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京って梅雨入りしたのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は父の日ですね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はお仕事でお家にいれなくて\n何もできなかったので\n今度お父さんには\nお誕生日プレゼントと父の日を兼ねて\nアコースティックギターを買いに行きたいと思います！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さんのアコースティックギター壊れちゃってから、なかったから(｡ρω-｡)。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、お母さんにもプレゼント買いたい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日プレゼントと母の日を兼ねて(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹ももうそろそろお誕生日で\nお兄ちゃんも６月お誕生日だったし\n私の家族は\nきみとしろみとチップ以外で\n５月～７月中にお誕生日終わっちゃうから\nクリスマスまでケーキがないの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキは食べるけど\nお誕生日ケーキがないの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、１０月生まれのチップには\n感謝です٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日ケーキたべたーい\n我慢できなーい\nって時期にお誕生日だから♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップときみとしろみにあいたいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/20/7909360/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/20/7909360/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お散歩であつくなっちゃって\nハアハアが止まらないチップ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハアハアしすぎて\n顔の皮膚が後ろに引っ張られて\nいつも以上に顔が薄く伸びて\n目がガチ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/20/7909360/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日お家に帰って\n明日の昼前くらいまで\nお家でダラダラできるよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにチップのお散歩にもいきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではきょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}